  <section id="transport">
    <h2>Getting to the parks</h2>
    <p>The Skyliner is the reason many people book here. The station is at the resort, and the line runs directly to EPCOT's International Gateway. A trip to Hollywood Studios uses the same system, with a transfer at Caribbean Beach. Buses cover the parks the Skyliner doesn't reach.</p>
