    <p class="note"><strong>How we rate ease:</strong> 5 is a direct Skyliner ride from a station at the hotel. 4 is a Skyliner trip with one transfer whose wait we haven't timed yet. 3 is a shared bus whose wait and travel time we haven't timed yet. These ratings are provisional until we time each trip ourselves. Skyliner hours can change with weather, and official pages say the system will close January 24 through 30, 2027, for refurbishment, with buses running that week.</p>
