  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Topolino's Terrace – Flavors of the Riviera</strong> is the rooftop restaurant. Breakfast is a character meal, Breakfast à la Art with Mickey &amp; Friends; Disney listed 7:30 a.m. to 12:15 p.m. when we checked, and you may see Mickey, Minnie, Donald and Daisy in outfits unique to this restaurant. Dinner is a Signature dining experience with French- and Italian-inspired dishes, listed at 5:00 p.m. to 9:30 p.m. Characters do not appear at dinner, and there is a dress code. Advance reservations are important. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></li>
      <li><strong>Primo Piatto</strong> is the quick-service restaurant, listed at 7:00 a.m. to 11:00 p.m. when we checked, for casual meals and snacks. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></li>
      <li><strong>Le Petit Cafe</strong> is the lobby cafe. Independent listings have had it open 6:30 a.m. to 9:00 p.m.; we have not confirmed those hours on a fully loaded official page in this pass. <span class="verify">[verify hours]</span></li>
      <li><strong>Bar Riva</strong> is the open-air pool bar, listed at 11:00 a.m. to 10:00 p.m. when we checked, with drinks and casual food. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></li>
      <li>You can use mobile ordering in the My Disney Experience app at the quick-service spots.</li>
      <li><strong>Park dining reservations:</strong> Disney resort guests can book their whole stay (up to 10 nights) starting 60 days before arrival. Topolino's Terrace books up, so plan ahead.</li>
    </ul>
