  <section id="pools">
    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>The Riviera Pool</strong> is the family pool, with a slide that winds around a column tower and S'il Vous Play, an interactive water-play area for kids.</li>
      <li><strong>Beau Soleil Pool</strong> is the quieter pool, in a calmer corner of the property.</li>
      <li>Towels are free at both pools. Hours and lifeguard coverage vary and can change.</li>
    </ul>
